{"ref":"BDB, מָסַס","hw":"מָסַס","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מָסַס</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. dissolve, melt</strong>, intr. <strong>(</strong>𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">מְסַס</span>; cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, מָסָה\" href=\"/BDB,_מָסָה\", dir=\"rtl\">מסה</a>, and <a data-ref=\"BDB, מָאַס²\" href=\"/BDB,_מָאַס²\", dir=\"rtl\">II. מאס</a><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְסֹס נֹסֵס</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.18\">Is 10:18</a>; <em>like the melting</em> (wasting away) of a <span dir=\"rtl\">נֹסֵס</span> (q.v.)<br><strong>Niph.</strong>  Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְנָמֵס</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.12\">Ez 21:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְנָמָ֑ס</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:21\" href=\"/Exodus.16.21\">Ex 16:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 112:10\" href=\"/Psalms.112.10\">ψ 112:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נָמַ֫סּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 97:5\" href=\"/Psalms.97.5\">ψ 97:5</a> + 2 times; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִמַּס</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 20:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.20.8\">Dt 20:8</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּמַּסּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 15:14\" href=\"/Judges.15.14\">Ju 15:14</a>; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִמֵּס</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.10\">2 S 17:10</a>; cstr. <em>id.</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:3\" href=\"/Psalms.68.3\">ψ 68:3</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָמֵס</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 22:15\" href=\"/Psalms.22.15\">ψ 22:15</a> + 2 times;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>melt</em> (intr.) of manna <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:21\" href=\"/Exodus.16.21\">Ex 16:21</a>; wax <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:3\" href=\"/Psalms.68.3\">ψ 68:3</a> (sim. of wicked); manacles <a data-ref=\"Judges 15:14\" href=\"/Judges.15.14\">Ju 15:14</a> (=<em>vanished, dropped off</em>); wicked <a data-ref=\"Psalms 112:10\" href=\"/Psalms.112.10\">ψ 112:10</a> (<em>melt away</em>); especially of hills and mts. <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:4\" href=\"/Micah.1.4\">Mi 1:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 97:5\" href=\"/Psalms.97.5\">ψ 97:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.3\">Is 34:3</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  most often fig. of heart=<em>faint, grow fearful</em>, <a data-ref=\"Nahum 2:11\" href=\"/Nahum.2.11\">Na 2:11</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.10\">2 S 17:10</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 20:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.20.8\">Dt 20:8</a> (Ges<sup>§ 121 b</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:11\" href=\"/Joshua.2.11\">Jos 2:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 5:2\" href=\"/Joshua.5.2\">5:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:5\" href=\"/Joshua.7.5\">7:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.7\">Is 13:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 19:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.19.1\">19:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.12\">Ez 21:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 22:15\" href=\"/Psalms.22.15\">ψ 22:15</a>. <strong>3.</strong>  Pt.=<em>wasted, consumptive</em> (?), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.9\">1 S 15:9</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נְמִבְזָה</span>, read <span dir=\"rtl\">נִבְזָה</span> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, בָּזָה\" href=\"/BDB,_בָּזָה\", dir=\"rtl\">בזה</a> <strong>Niph.</strong>) < read <span dir=\"rtl\">נִמְאֶסֶת</span> <em>worthless</em>, lit. <em>rejected</em> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, מָאַס\" href=\"/BDB,_מָאַס\", dir=\"rtl\">מאס</a> <strong>Niph.</strong>)<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  Pf. 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵמַסּוּ אֶת־לְבָבֵנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:28\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.28\">Dt 1:28</a> <em>cause to melt</em> (=intimidate).","next":"BDB, מַס³","prev":"BDB, מַסְמֵר"}